     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Reporting information",
     "texto": [
      "**Enligt artikeln…** shows where the information comes from. Use neutral verbs such as **uppger** («states») or **beskriver** («describes»), and keep that information separate from your own judgement."
